### Cake Platform API - Order Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/owner/orders
@authUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### =========================================
### 0. Authenticate to get Token
### =========================================
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "owner@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the token from the login response
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### =========================================
### 1. Order Management Tests
### =========================================

### 1a. List all Orders for my Shop
# @name listOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1b. Get details of a specific Order
# Replace the ID '1' with an actual order ID if your database is populated
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1c. Update Order Status
# Replace the ID '1' with an actual order ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "PREPARING"
}

### 1d. Download Order Invoice (PDF)
# Replace the ID '1' with an actual order ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
